{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4a49b4d70635ec33","name":"Gambling Leader Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-4a49b4d70635ec33","title":"Gambling Leader Talent Tree","revision":20650,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:15:02Z","sha256":"0a2739fd7fd9ade9873d6c695737ec132f2c825c3c153bb4f0f4d3cda5ee5793","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20650","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gambling%20Leader%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4a49b4d70635ec33","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You aren't afraid to take chances when leading your allies, and you risk defeat in exchange for a shot at even the most unlikely victories. You put yourself on the front lines to encourage your allies to overcome long odds.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Assault Gambit"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per turn, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can designate one ally and one enemy that have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Effect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Effect"}," to each other. The ally and the enemy make opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," checks, and the winner can make a single immediate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against the loser. No character can benefit from this Talent more than once per round.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Direct Fire"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Assault Gambit"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can designate one ally and one target that does not have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," from you. Until the start of your next turn, the ally you designate ignores the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," bonuses to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Face the Foe"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you do not have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," from a target, you gain a +1 morale bonus to attack rolls against that target.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Lead From the Front"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Face the Foe"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you do not have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," from a target that you damaged with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},", all your allies gain a +2 morale bonus to attack rolls against that target and a +5 circumstance bonus to opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," checks against that target until the start of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Luck Favors the Bold"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Face the Foe"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If at least one enemy within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," is aware of you and you do not have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," against that enemy, at the start of your turn if you are conscious you gain a number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," equal to 5 + one-half your Heroic Level. Damage is subtracted from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," first, and any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," remaining at the end of the encounter are lost. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," do not stack.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
